### ==============================================================================
### DONATIONS & SECTION 80G TAX EXEMPTION RECEIPT WORKFLOW APIS
### Zero-fraud statutory compliance: No direct fake receipts! Admin reviews before 80G receipt dispatch!
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@userToken = REPLACE_WITH_USER_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@adminSecretKey = BYK_SUPER_ADMIN_ALIGARH_SECRET_2026

### 1. Initiate Donation / Create Order
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/create-order
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2500,
  "donorName": "Suresh Aggarwal",
  "email": "suresh.aggarwal@example.com",
  "phone": "9812345678",
  "pan": "ABCDE1234F",
  "address": "Civil Lines, Aligarh, UP",
  "campaignTitle": "Winter Warmth & Youth Education Drive"
}

### 2. Submit Donation with Payment Proof / UTR
### (Stores status 'pending'. NO official 80G receipt is generated yet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/donations/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 2500,
  "donorName": "Suresh Aggarwal",
  "email": "suresh.aggarwal@example.com",
  "phone": "9812345678",
  "pan": "ABCDE1234F",
  "address": "Civil Lines, Aligarh, UP",
  "campaignTitle": "Winter Warmth & Youth Education Drive",
  "orderId": "order_1791885414165",
  "transactionId": "UPI428198759231",
  "paymentScreenshot": "/uploads/donation_screenshot_1.jpg"
}

### 3. Admin: List All Donations (Filter by Pending / Approved)
GET {{baseUrl}}/donations?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}

### 4. Admin: Approve Donation
### (Generates official BYK-80G-2026-XXXX receipt number and auto-emails 80G PDF receipt to donor)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/donations/DONATION_ID_HERE/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Admin: Reject Donation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/donations/DONATION_ID_HERE/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Payment not credited to Trust Bank account."
}

### 6. Admin: Export All 80G Donations to Excel (.xlsx)
GET {{baseUrl}}/donations/export/excel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
x-admin-secret-key: {{adminSecretKey}}
